# backslash-comment-chain: Does a swallowed comment line that ends in a backslash swallow the line after it (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: v@3=2
# pc: ODE0076
# ruling: the chain continues through every comment line that ends in a backslash; the first line without one is swallowed too, and PhaseCont gives one warning for it (language.md, Lines).
# first \
# second \
x'=1
x'=2
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
